@startuml 04-app-lab-effect-cycle
title Rastok — same semantic step, different effect world

actor Caller
participant "Rastok entry point" as Entry
participant "Deterministic\nsemantic core" as Core
participant "Effect boundary" as Boundary
participant "App Process\nhandler" as App
participant "Lab controlled\nhandler" as Lab
database "Typed journal" as Journal

Caller -> Entry: execute checked plan
Entry -> Core: step(plan, state, input event)
Core -> Journal: append input / decision records
Core --> Entry: new state + Process intent
Entry -> Boundary: resolve(intent, mode)

alt App mode
  Boundary -> App: typed Process intent
  App -> App: perform real host effect
  App --> Boundary: typed outcome
else Lab mode
  Boundary -> Lab: same typed Process intent
  Lab -> Lab: consume scripted outcome or fault
  Lab --> Boundary: typed controlled outcome
end

Boundary -> Journal: append outcome event
Boundary -> Core: outcome as next event
Core --> Entry: next state + intents or completion
Entry --> Caller: result and review evidence

note over Core,Journal
No wall clock, randomness, environment,
filesystem, or network enters the core implicitly.
end note
@enduml
